# LenTraq Swagger

When adding or changing API endpoints in `backend/`:

1. Keep controllers free of OpenAPI attributes / `@OA` PHPDoc
2. Add or update a dedicated class under `backend/app/Swagger/Endpoints/{Domain}/` (one operation per file)
3. Put shared shapes in `backend/app/Swagger/Schemas/`
4. Use PHP 8 `OpenApi\Attributes as OA` only; scan path is `app/Swagger`
5. Include full paths (`/api/v1/...`), tags, and `bearerAuth` for Sanctum-protected routes
6. Run `php artisan l5-swagger:generate` after doc changes (UI at `/docs`)

Follow the **lentraq-swagger** skill for full layout, checklist, and examples.
